                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The defeated candidate laughed <w>mirthlessly</w> at the unexpected outcome of the election.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "cs": "Poražený kandidát se nečekanému výsledku voleb <w>trpce</w> zasmál."
